Third-party data bundled with pdf2kicad
========================================

Device.kicad_sym is a reduced copy containing only the C, FerriteBead, L,
and R symbols extracted from KiCad's Device symbol library. Connector.kicad_sym
contains only the TestPoint symbol from KiCad's Connector symbol library. They
are bundled so standard-symbol substitution works without a local KiCad
installation.

Source:  KiCad Libraries — https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-symbols
